{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cep4cvuNe1b6PgWgfQFrw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass successfully. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented the shipment confirmation endpoint (`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm`) for the BE-003 requirement.\n\n### Changes Made\n\n**1. Added new error code** (`src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt`):\n   - Added `SHIPMENT_CANCELLED` error code for conflict responses when attempting to confirm a cancelled shipment\n\n**2. Implemented confirm endpoint** (`src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt`):\n   - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that:\n     - Returns 404 with `SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND` if shipment doesn't exist\n     - Returns 409 with `SHIPMENT_CANCELLED` if shipment status is `CANCELLED`\n     - Returns 200 with unchanged shipment if already `CONFIRMED` (idempotent retry support)\n     - Returns 200 with updated shipment if `CREATED` (transitions to `CONFIRMED`)\n\n**3. Added comprehensive tests** (`src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt`):\n   - Test confirming a created shipment moves it to CONFIRMED\n   - Test that confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds idempotently\n   - Test that confirming a cancelled shipment returns 409 conflict\n   - Test that confirming a non-existent shipment returns 404 not found\n\n### Verification\n- ✅ All 17 tests pass (13 existing + 4 new)\n- ✅ No new Maven dependencies added\n- ✅ Only modified shipment feature files and the shared API error code enum\n- ✅ Follows existing Kotlin + Spring Boot architecture patterns\n- ✅ Error responses consistent with the rest of the API"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2345,"cache_read_input_tokens":46209,"cache_cre